OL,3,GNEWSALegal challenge to Drumcree parade
OL,4,Adecision to be heard
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large crowd has gathered outside the
OL,7,FHigh Court in Belfast ahead of a legal
OL,8,Fchallenge to the Parades Commission's
OL,9,Fdecision to allow the Orange Order to
OL,10,Fmarch on the mainly-nationalist
OL,11,FGarvaghy Road in Portadown.
OL,13,FThe commission announced that the
OL,14,Fparade can go ahead on Sunday, for the
OL,15,Ffirst time in almost 30 years, with
OL,16,Frestrictions in place.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
